#ROOMS

#4810
The Lucky Dragon Casino - Entrance~
   You step through a pair of gilded doors into the Lucky Dragon Casino.  Rich
red velvet drapes the walls and polished brass fixtures gleam in the warm light.
Above the reception desk, a large golden dragon twists in an eternal coil, its
emerald eyes watching every arrival.  The casino floor lies to the south, the
noise of gaming and laughter drifting through.  The gilded doors to the north
lead back to Dresden's Market Plaza.
~
