#4811
Casino Main Floor~
   The main floor blazes with light from dozens of magical lanterns suspended
overhead.  The air hums with excitement and the steady clink of gold.  Rows of
gilded slot machines fill the centre of the room -- each one engraved with a
serpentine dragon coiling around the reels.  To the east a low archway opens
onto the dice and card tables.  West lies the bar, its amber bottles promising
consolation to the unlucky.  The entrance is back through the velvet rope to
the north.
~
