#4813
The Dragon's Bar~
   Polished bottles in every colour line the mirrored wall behind the bar,
catching the lamplight like a stained glass window.  The barkeeper works in
quiet, methodical silence, polishing glasses with a clean white cloth while
soft lute music from somewhere unseen fills the air.  Comfortable stools invite
tired gamblers to rest and reflect on their fortunes -- or misfortunes.
~
